ign(Name(\"candidate\"),\n+              BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"candidate\"), Int(1))))\n+          Return(Name(\"primes\"))))\n+    </k>\n+    <n> N </n>\n+    <result> .K </result>\n+    =>\n+    <k> .K </k>\n+    <n> N </n>\n+    <result> primesBelow(N) </result>\n+    requires N >=Int 0\n+endmodule\n*** End Patch";
